# Build context for the production image: source only, no secrets or outputs.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/storybook-static
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.codegraph
.fallow
.orca
.motte
docs
# Secrets: the image never contains env values (they come from the env file).
**/.env*
!**/.env.schema
